<%# The Settings module (cs-studio spec §6.1, Task 8): title, tagline,
    logo, social links and the default language, all through one
    autosaving form (`Admin::SettingsFormComponent`) -- the title and
    tagline in whichever language is being edited (`admin_locale`,
    translation helpers spec §5). %>
<% content_for :title, "Settings" %>
<h1 class="mb-4 text-h1 text-ink">Settings</h1>

<div class="mt-2">
  <%= render Admin::SettingsFormComponent.new(site_setting: @site_setting, locale: admin_locale, url_options: admin_url_options) %>
</div>
